    {
      "id": "tide-sig-12",
      "name": "Rael signature",
      "shortName": "Event Copy Combo",
      "displayName": "Manifold Incantation",
      "displayDescription": "Multiplies the force of each event, feeding its engine on cards cast into the void.",
      "summary": "A spell-chaining combo deck that multiplies the impact of individual events through a suite of copy effects, distinguishing itself from its nearest sibling by treating discard as engine fuel rather than as a standalone value accumulator.",
      "description": "Tide-sig-12 is built around stacking event-copying effects to turn a single cheap spell into two, three, or more effects in one turn. The core engine runs through Echo Architect (which copies every event you play at the cost of 1● extra per spell), Twice-Lit Portal and Cascading Detonation (which set up the next event to copy once or twice respectively, with Cascading Detonation returning 5● via reclaim), and The Ringleader (which creates a free ephemeral copy of the next event on the turn it enters). Cascade of Reflections extends this further by copying every event played for an entire turn. Discard mechanics — Key Sifter drawing back each discarded card, Torchbearer of the Abyss replacing each discard with a card and 1●, Sunken Radiance cycling two cards with a 2● reclaim — exist primarily to keep the hand full and find copying pieces rather than as value destinations in their own right. Targeted removal through fast/interrupt events like Molten Duel and Fell the Mighty provides interaction while remaining copy-able. Call of the Lost rewards high-volume turns by materializing a board of awakened ember figments equal to cards played. The nearest sibling, tide-sig-13, overlaps heavily on shared events and discard enablers but centers its payoffs on discard-value characters such as Wandering Archivist (gaining ⍟ per discard), Starcatcher (gaining ● per event played), and Hatching Ground scaling erode with cards played — a midrange accumulation pattern rather than a combo-copy burst.",
      "color": "blue",
      "claims": {"tribe": "events", "mechanics": ["discard","reclaim","copy"]},
      "role": "signature",
      "dreamAvatarId": "84E7020C-7384-4CC3-A20F-AB05F03CC375",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"11b4ae1d-ae2a-41a6-9cdc-70c6d69803d6","name":"Fell the Mighty","text":"You may pay an additional 3● to play this event. Dissolve a ≤2✦ enemy. If the additional cost was paid, dissolve any enemy instead.","copies":2},
        {"id":"21965e95-0c8c-470c-a1e1-06d7b87a8d00","name":"Echo Architect","subtype":"Tinkerer","text":"Events cost you 1● more.\n\nWhen you play an event, copy it.","copies":2},
        {"id":"2690912e-0295-4d12-a603-5946d37902d3","name":"Call the Lost","text":"For each card you've played this turn, materialize a 2✦ shadow figment.\n\nReclaim 2●","copies":2},
        {"id":"2931e20b-1a80-4ddd-8944-20e68d182886","name":"Sunken Radiance","text":"Draw 2 cards, then discard 2 cards.\n\nReclaim 2●.","copies":2},
        {"id":"4cec92f2-9bac-4949-a602-cd0a44618aaf","name":"The Ringleader","subtype":"Visitor","text":"▸Materialized: The next time you play an event this turn, create a 0● ephemeral copy of that event in your hand.","copies":2},
        {"id":"6044f6da-cf71-4dbb-9feb-f71ae66a4f5b","name":"Molten Duel","text":"Dissolve a ≤3✦ character.","copies":2},
        {"id":"650b2ed4-f016-46c0-815a-f53fffe08a9a","name":"Part the Veil","text":"Erode 4. You may put two of those cards into your hand.\n\nWhen you discard this card, it gains reclaim 2●.","copies":2},
        {"id":"6f0b709d-0f57-46de-bfba-6a8b4df2b991","name":"Secrets of the Deep","text":"Gain 3⍟. If you reclaimed this card, gain 6⍟ instead.\n\nReclaim 4●","copies":2},
