    {
      "id": "tide-fac-01",
      "name": "Lean: Skull Weaver",
      "shortName": "Abandon Scaling",
      "displayName": "The Mounting Tithe",
      "displayDescription": "Channels each sacrifice into growing power and stored charges that strike down foes.",
      "summary": "This tide fuels three interlocking abandon payoffs — ⍟ income, ✦ growth on individual threats, and stored ⧗ charges that cash out as targeted removal — while its closest sibling redirects abandon into reclaiming a massive high-spark finisher instead.",
      "description": "Tide-fac-01 is an almost entirely character-based (40 of 45 copies) midrange engine that treats abandoning its own allies as a resource rather than a cost. The dominant sink for that resource runs along three parallel tracks: generating ⍟ income through characters that watch allies leave play, growing individual characters' ✦ through repeated abandons (Herald of the Last Light gains +1✦ per abandon and converts that investment into card draw; Harvester of Despair and Cinderheart follow the same pattern), and charging ⧗ counters on Kindlehorn and Obliterator of Worlds to dissolve enemies sized to match those counters. The Dread Sovereign adds a fourth angle — exhausting plus abandoning to discover and immediately materialize a character of chosen cost — giving the deck a tutorlike way to find expensive threats without committing hard mana upfront. Two copies of the cheap survivor Kindred Sparks let the deck replay threats from the void for a single ●, and Stolen Genesis converts an abandon directly into a free higher-cost character from the deck. Compared to its nearest sibling (fac-14), which shares the core abandon shell but includes The Rising God as an eight-cost high-spark finisher reclaimed via abandoning two characters, this tide forgoes the top-end power spike in favor of a more distributed, board-controlling plan: growing wide threats through ✦ accumulation and keeping the enemy board in check via the ⧗ removal engine.",
      "color": "orange",
      "claims": {"tribe": "Survivor", "mechanics": ["abandon","figment"]},
      "role": "facet",
      "leanCardId": "ffec9fdd-d948-4756-b7df-39b9e982613e",
