    {
      "id": "tide-fac-09",
      "name": "Lean: Scorched Reckoning",
      "shortName": "Void Reclaim Finisher",
      "displayName": "The Reclaimed Colossus",
      "displayDescription": "Floods the void to unlock cheap recursion and high-spark giants.",
      "summary": "A lean erode-and-discard tide that deliberately floods the void to unlock cheap reclaim plays and the Paradox Enforcer, a 7✦ finisher that costs only 1● once seven void cards are banished — distinguishing it from the nearest siblings by concentrating on void accumulation as a resource rather than abandon payoffs or raw draw cycling.",
      "description": "Tide-fac-09 is almost entirely characters (39 of 45 copies), built around a tightly focused loop: fill your void through erode triggers and discard outlets, then cash it in for overwhelming late-game threats. The engine runs on repeatable void-feeders — Searcher in the Mists erodes 4 each time it enters or leaves play, Fargazer erodes 1 for every character played while providing its own Reclaim 2● to return, and Evacuation Enforcer's activated ability draws 2 then discards 3, rapidly stocking the void while cycling toward payoffs. Once the void is deep enough, Veil of the Wastes and Graywatch return themselves to play for free off cheap character plays, Soulkindler pumps all allied ✦ from the void passively, and the Paradox Enforcer arrives as a 7✦ body for just 1● by banishing seven void cards. The Rising God caps the curve with a high-spark 7✦ body that reclaims for only 2● plus the cost of abandoning two characters. Compared to the Lean: Shadowcaller facet, which leans on abandon triggers and sacrifice payoffs to generate value, this tide treats the void as an accumulating fuel reserve rather than a sacrifice engine; and unlike the Corvath signature pool's discard-cycling plan centered on draw-heavy cards like Sunken Radiance and Urban Cipher for card velocity, this tide discards specifically to deepen the void toward reclaim and banish thresholds rather than to refresh hand size.",
      "color": "purple",
      "claims": {"tribe": "events", "mechanics": ["discard","reclaim","copy"]},
      "role": "facet",
