    {
      "id": "tide-fac-11",
      "name": "Lean: Infernal Cavalier",
      "shortName": "Dissolved Void Loop",
      "displayName": "The Deathless Warband",
      "displayDescription": "Refuels the hand and board from the void itself, looping fallen Warriors endlessly back.",
      "summary": "This tide floods the board with spirit animals and figment tokens, converts that width into energy via Dawn ramp, and then closes with a burst pump finisher — where its nearest sibling focuses on support-layer buffing and card draw through Ghostlight Wolves and Eternal Stag, this tide instead runs Dreamborne Leviathan and Spiritbound Alpha to generate and then weaponize a wide token board.",
      "description": "Tide-fac-30 is built almost entirely around spirit animal characters (36 of 45 copies are characters), with its central engine resting on three doubles. Dreamborne Leviathan generates a 1✦ spirit animal figment every time you play a spirit animal, rapidly expanding the board; Skyborne Jellyfish then converts that width into energy each Dawn by gaining 1● for each allied character costing 2● or less; and Spiritbound Alpha closes games with a ❖ ability that pays 5● to grant all allied spirit animals +3✦ and vengeful for the turn. Spirit Bond backs this up as a second payoff, granting every ally +X✦ where X equals the number of allies, rewarding the same board width. The play pattern is to chain low-cost spirit animals through the early turns (with Celestial Reverie or Luminous Ascent drawing through the gas), let Leviathan compound the board with free tokens, and then spend the energy stockpile on Alpha or Spirit Bond for a lethal swing. Compared to its nearest sibling (tide-fac-21), which centers Eternal Stag and Ghostlight Wolves at two copies each to support and buff existing allies more incrementally, this tide skips the support layer and instead leans on token generation and a decisive ❖ pump burst as its primary payoff structure.",
      "color": "green",
      "claims": {"tribe": "Warrior", "mechanics": ["abandon"]},
      "role": "facet",
      "leanCardId": "b64f0beb-6ba4-4559-b6ab-091c2f60a613",
