        {"id":"01d53e49-7833-4122-a970-b72c73ad2c28","name":"Crimson Pilgrimage","text":"Look at the top 4 cards of your deck. Choose one: Draw 1 of the cards, or draw 2 of the cards and they gain ephemeral.","copies":1},
        {"id":"08fe3190-f559-4152-941d-33ec4180f509","name":"Data Pulse","text":"Gain 2●. Draw a card.","copies":1},
        {"id":"0d848dc8-a1a2-410b-b19a-b5f65375e141","name":"Path to Redemption","text":"Until end of turn, cards in your void gain reclaim.","copies":1},
        {"id":"11b4ae1d-ae2a-41a6-9cdc-70c6d69803d6","name":"Fell the Mighty","text":"You may pay an additional 3● to play this event. Dissolve a ≤2✦ enemy. If the additional cost was paid, dissolve any enemy instead.","copies":1},
        {"id":"1434440c-c86f-4b7d-83e7-3bd1f7dde63e","name":"Pulse of Sacrifice","text":"Discard your hand. Gain 3●.","copies":1},
        {"id":"21965e95-0c8c-470c-a1e1-06d7b87a8d00","name":"Echo Architect","subtype":"Tinkerer","text":"Events cost you 1● more.\n\nWhen you play an event, copy it.","copies":1},
        {"id":"25173cac-333f-4efc-9a03-b532d5783419","name":"Stratospheric Voyage","text":"Return a character to its controller's hand. Gain 2●.","copies":1},
        {"id":"2690912e-0295-4d12-a603-5946d37902d3","name":"Call the Lost","text":"For each card you've played this turn, materialize a 2✦ shadow figment.\n\nReclaim 2●","copies":1},
        {"id":"2931e20b-1a80-4ddd-8944-20e68d182886","name":"Sunken Radiance","text":"Draw 2 cards, then discard 2 cards.\n\nReclaim 2●.","copies":1},
        {"id":"4cec92f2-9bac-4949-a602-cd0a44618aaf","name":"The Ringleader","subtype":"Visitor","text":"▸Materialized: The next time you play an event this turn, create a 0● ephemeral copy of that event in your hand.","copies":1},
