        {"id":"4e3c04a9-1cdd-468a-b42a-40157ed9c9d6","name":"Eternal Stag","subtype":"Spirit Animal","text":"Support – Supported spirit animals have +1✦.\n\n2●, ☾: Draw a spirit animal.","copies":2},
