    {
      "id": "tide-fac-28",
      "name": "Lean: Oracle of Shifting Skies",
      "shortName": "Event Copy Ramp",
      "displayName": "Twice-Cast Power",
      "displayDescription": "Ramps fast, then copies its most powerful events for devastating effect.",
      "summary": "An event-copy tide that uses The Ringleader and copy spells to multiply high-impact events, while discard-and-reclaim engines keep the hand full and turn the event-heavy void into threat growth.",
      "description": "This tide is split between characters and events (22 characters, 23 events), with its identity centered on copying and recurring spells rather than warrior sacrifice. The doubled anchor is The Ringleader, whose materialized trigger creates a free ephemeral copy of the next event played that turn. That effect is backed by Entropy Cascade, Twice-Lit Portal, Echoes of Eternity, and Cascade of Reflections, giving the tide several ways to multiply removal, draw, ramp, and token-making events. The discard package keeps those turns fueled: Sunken Radiance, Grotto Seer, Reset, Seek Answers, Key Sifter, Pattern Seeker, Iconoclast, Rubble Diviner, Wandering Archivist, and Minstrel of Falling Light all move cards through hand while replacing or rewarding the discard. Reclaim and event-void support from From the Barrow, Archive of the Forgotten, Weblight Waif, Ashlight Caller, Part the Veil, Annihilation from Below, and Pinnacle Ascendant make the discarded events matter after they leave hand. Oracle of Shifting Skies gives repeat foresight on event plays, while Architect of Memory, Shaper of Memory, and Minstrel of Falling Light convert a stocked void into board pressure. The result is a copy-ramp event deck with discard-reclaim sustain.",
      "color": "yellow",
      "claims": {"tribe": "events", "mechanics": ["discard","reclaim"]},
      "role": "facet",
      "leanCardId": "e455225f-c444-44a2-8796-805cae2b755f",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"4cec92f2-9bac-4949-a602-cd0a44618aaf","name":"The Ringleader","subtype":"Visitor","text":"▸Materialized: The next time you play an event this turn, create a 0● ephemeral copy of that event in your hand.","copies":2},
