    {
      "id": "tide-neu-01",
      "name": "Broad: Crimson Pilgrimage / Data Pulse",
      "shortName": "Event Interrupt Tempo",
      "displayName": "The Undertow",
      "displayDescription": "A flexible event pool blending reactive denial with cheap copying and resourceful draw.",
      "summary": "A generalist event-heavy tide that combines reactive interrupts with cheap event-copying payoffs and energy-positive draw filtering, distinguishing itself from the Kasane signature by running no reclaim or token-chain infrastructure and instead prioritizing counterspell denial tools like Defiant Parry, Cragfall, Abolish, and Crumbling Covenant.",
      "description": "tide-neu-01 is a broad neutral tide built almost entirely from events (23 of 30 cards), with every card appearing as a single copy — a deliberate sampler of tools rather than a focused engine. Its play pattern revolves around using cheap, energy-positive events (Data Pulse for +2● and a draw, Starcatcher turning each event into +1●, Pulse of Sacrifice converting a dead hand into +3●) to build an energy lead while filtering the deck through draw events like Crimson Pilgrimage, Fragments of Vision, Gleam Below, and Dreamscatter. The interrupt suite is a genuine distinguishing feature: Defiant Parry taxes opponent plays, Abolish hard-counters any card, Cragfall counters and puts the card into your hand, and Crumbling Covenant forces the opponent to abandon a large character or let their play be denied — giving this tide unusually strong reactive tools for a neutral package. Event-copying payoffs (Echo Architect's copy-each-event trigger, Echoes of Eternity and Cosmonaut of Tides copying cheap events) reward chaining low-cost events into bursts of copied value. Compared to the Kasane signature tide, which at double the card count commits deeply to a reclaim and token-generation loop — using Archive of the Forgotten, Path to Redemption, and From the Barrow to recur events and Call of the Lost to convert event-chains into token armies — tide-neu-01 carries none of that reclaim infrastructure and generates no tokens from event play; it instead wins by denying opponent tempo through its interrupts and sustaining card and energy advantage turn over turn with efficient filtering.",
      "color": "blue",
      "claims": {"tribe": "events"},
      "role": "neutral",
      "leanCardId": "a911ef71-799c-4240-ad13-8fabd3caeafa",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"01d53e49-7833-4122-a970-b72c73ad2c28","name":"Crimson Pilgrimage","text":"Look at the top 4 cards of your deck. Choose one: Draw 1 of the cards, or draw 2 of the cards and they gain ephemeral.","copies":1},
        {"id":"08fe3190-f559-4152-941d-33ec4180f509","name":"Data Pulse","text":"Gain 2●. Draw a card.","copies":1},
        {"id":"1434440c-c86f-4b7d-83e7-3bd1f7dde63e","name":"Pulse of Sacrifice","text":"Discard your hand. Gain 3●.","copies":1},
        {"id":"145f72b9-5ff7-4477-b7f5-55ca89a135ae","name":"Defiant Parry","text":"Offering\n\nPrevent a played card unless the opponent pays 1●.","copies":1},
        {"id":"1654d50f-815d-4172-b46b-8baa34a124db","name":"Overwhelm","text":"Prevent a played card, then put that card into your hand.","copies":1},
        {"id":"21965e95-0c8c-470c-a1e1-06d7b87a8d00","name":"Echo Architect","subtype":"Tinkerer","text":"Events cost you 1● more.\n\nWhen you play an event, copy it.","copies":1},
        {"id":"25173cac-333f-4efc-9a03-b532d5783419","name":"Stratospheric Voyage","text":"Return a character to its controller's hand. Gain 2●.","copies":1},
        {"id":"25d00336-5ad7-433b-8ced-71720a9f074a","name":"Wheel of the Heavens","text":"Each player shuffles their hand and void into their deck, then draws 5 cards. Banish this card.","copies":1},
        {"id":"29088c75-c2c9-40dc-a77a-65360e464b45","name":"Abolish","text":"Prevent a played card.","copies":1},
        {"id":"29d25251-8b42-4d3d-97e6-6c3abaabd9a2","name":"Blooming Horror","text":"Choose a player. For each card you've played this turn, that player erodes 2.","copies":1},
        {"id":"3725379c-676d-4efd-81ee-7e45d80db6d0","name":"Fragments of Vision","text":"Draw 3 cards, then shuffle 2 cards from your hand into your deck.","copies":1},
