        {"id":"a75c22ac-e343-4757-964e-a0bb981b5a28","name":"Spiritbound Alpha","subtype":"Spirit Animal","text":"❖ – 5●: Spirit animals you control gain +3✦ and vengeful until end of turn.","copies":1},
