        {"id":"7977748d-02c1-4702-ba68-5c49f7f0759b","name":"Flesh Cultivator","subtype":"Visitor","text":"☾, Abandon a ≤2● cost character: Materialize a random ≤2● cost character from your deck. This character gains +1✦.","copies":1},
